    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      Aster Chain exposes a JSON-RPC 2.0 endpoint at <code>{ASTER_API_FACTS.rpcBase}</code>. It is separate from the
      trading API and is used for chain-level reads.
